{
  "name": "ShowHisAlarmCsns",
  "summary": "查询历史告警流水号",
  "tags": "告警管理",
  "productshort": "ManageOneOCHCS",
  "region_id": "cn-north-4",
  "paths": {
    "/rest/fault/v1/history-alarms/csns": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "查询历史告警流水号",
        "description": "历史告警初始查询,获取告警流水号列表。\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量(tiny2)|1tps|\n|吞吐量(small)|1tps|\n|吞吐量(medium)|1tps|\n|吞吐量(large)|1tps|\n|TP50请求时延|10000ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|120000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "此接口必须在HTTPS通道上访问。查询条件建议包含索引字段,避免查询时间过长导致性能问题。建议字段:OCCURUTC(优先选择)、ALARMID、CSN、MEDN、MODN、NATIVEMEDN、TENANTID...",
        "tags": [
          "告警管理"
        ],
        "operationId": "ShowHisAlarmCsns",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "queryParam",
            "in": "body",
            "description": "查询参数。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/AlarmQueryParam"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询结果,返回符合条件的告警数、告警流水号。",
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "count": 10,
                "sizeExceeded": true,
                "csns": [
                  80301534,
                  80297793,
                  80296264,
                  80296236,
                  80282656,
                  80281893,
                  80280083,
                  80279399,
                  80243521,
                  80243514
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "参数非法。"
          }
        },
        "x-support-sdk": "N",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "POST https://{endpoint}/rest/fault/v1/history-alarms/csns",
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "",
        "x-request-examples-1": {
          "query": {
            "filters": [
              {
                "name": "OCCURUTC",
                "field": "OCCURUTC",
                "operator": "BETWEEN",
                "values": [
                  "1490976000000",
                  "1491235200000"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "expression": ""
          },
          "sort": [
            {
              "field": "CSN",
              "order": "desc"
            }
          ],
          "size": 20
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "AlarmQueryParam": {
      "description": "当前告警/历史告警/被屏蔽告警/事件 查询参数",
      "properties": {
        "dataType": {
          "description": "该参数只对“/fmdata/v1/alarms”的post方法必要,可取值为:current-当前告警查询,history-历史告警查询,shielded-屏蔽告警查询,event-事件查询",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "query": {
          "description": "过滤条件",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/QueryContext"
        },
        "sort": {
          "description": "排序条件",
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/QSortField"
          }
        },
        "size": {
          "description": "返回的结果集最大条数,按设置的排序条件,返回最前的N条记录。无此条件或者不是正整数时,表示查询全部。结果集最大不超过2万条。",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "default": 2147483647
        }
      }
    },
    "QFilterElement": {
      "description": "单个过滤条件",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "description": "条件名称,唯一标识一个过滤条件",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "field": {
          "description": "条件对应的字段名称,当前支持的字段有:",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "operator": {
          "description": "条件操作符,当前支持的操作符有:\"=\"等于,\"<\"小于,\"<=\"小于等于,\">\"大于,\">=\"大于等于,\"!=\"不等于,\"in\"属于集合,\"like\"包含字符串,\"between\"介于两个数字之间",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "values": {
          "description": "条件取值",
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000,
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QSortField": {
      "description": "单个排序条件",
      "properties": {
        "field": {
          "description": "排序字段",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "order": {
          "description": "升降序,“ASC”升序,“DESC”降序",
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "QueryContext": {
      "description": "查询过滤条件",
      "properties": {
        "filters": {
          "description": "一组过滤条件的集合",
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/QFilterElement"
          }
        },
        "expression": {
          "description": "由\"and\"、\"or\"、\"not\"、括号和QFilterElement的name组成的条件逻辑表达式。目前只支持\"and\"关系;没有该tag时默认所有条件元素为\"and\"关系",
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "2.0",
  "parameters": {},
  "host": "hcs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com",
  "base_path": "/",
  "info_version": "v1",
  "method": "post",
  "uri": null
}